iki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},". The Sith Battle Harness also has a built-in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Cannon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Cannon","referenceId":"reference:ae1584087cb7657b"},", powered by an onboard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Generator","referenceId":"reference:bbf4ffdc29b0d2b7"}," providing unlimited ammunition.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
